    <h1 style="font-size:2rem">Service Overview</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 6 August 2026</p>

    <h2>1. What BureauFlow Is</h2>
    <p>BureauFlow is a payroll bureau management platform — a CRM built for UK payroll professionals. It brings a bureau’s clients, HMRC deadlines, checklists, and pension obligations into one dashboard, sitting alongside whatever payroll engine the bureau already uses.</p>
    <p>BureauFlow does not calculate payroll, file tax returns, or submit information to HMRC. It manages the practice around those activities.</p>

    <h2>2. Core Capabilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Client management</strong> — every client, PAYE reference, and pension status in one place</li>
      <li><strong>HMRC deadline tracking</strong> — RTI, FPS, and EPS deadlines calculated automatically from pay dates</li>
      <li><strong>Payroll checklists</strong> — templates for each payroll cycle, including year-end and new starters</li>
      <li><strong>Pension and auto-enrolment tracking</strong> — AE status, postponement, and re-enrolment</li>
      <li><strong>Bureau metrics</strong> — revenue, on-time rate, and client health across the practice</li>
      <li><strong>Penny AI assistant</strong> — an optional feature that answers questions across the bureau’s data in plain English</li>
      <li><strong>Audit trail</strong> — changes to client records and settings are logged automatically</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Access and Tiers</h2>
    <p>The Service is browser-based with nothing to install, accessed at <a href="https://app.bureauflow.co.uk">app.bureauflow.co.uk</a> with self-serve signup. A Free tier is available for individual consultants, and paid tiers serve bureaus and organisations — see <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> and the <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>4. Hosting and Data</h2>
    <p>The Service is hosted on cloud infrastructure with the primary database located in the EU (Frankfurt). Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, with encrypted daily backups. Details of the providers we use are in Section 5 of the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, and our security measures are described on the <a href="/security">Security</a> page.</p>

    <h2>5. Support</h2>
    <p>Support is provided by email at <a href="mailto:support@bureauflow.co.uk">support@bureauflow.co.uk</a>. We aim to respond promptly.</p>

    <h2>6. Updates and Maintenance</h2>
    <p>The Service is updated regularly as improvements and fixes become available.</p>

